{"title":"The Decline of Manufacturing","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916718684/0/marginalrevolution~The-Decline-of-Manufacturing.html","date":1744715905000,"content":"<p>Look at the incredible decline of manufacturing across a wide variety of industries in the figure below. Nearly 7.5 million jobs lost, just since 2011. Devastated communities. Factories shuttered. Millions of older, lower-skilled workers out of work. A rise in inequality. Jobs going overseas.</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>“The future is bleak and hopeless if we continue like this,” said one worker.</p>\r\n<p>…“This eventually leads to serious social problems, such as higher rates of unemployment and increased crime and social unrest. Nations with socially polarised work forces also suffer from political instability.”\r\n<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/China-Manufacturing.png\" width=\"769\" height=\"496\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/China-Manufacturing.png 1143w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/China-Manufacturing-300x194.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/China-Manufacturing-1024x661.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/China-Manufacturing-768x496.png 768w\" /></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And now for the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/7640fe64-006a-4d46-9564-cbb2bd89ebd4?shareType=nongift\">rest of the story</a> (<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://archive.is/GMoVZ\">non-paywalled </a>or go to the comments.)</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/the-decline-of-manufacturing.html\">The Decline of Manufacturing</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\"